{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929530/extras/cfc63e41b7f61b42572526493e4b399e.avif?t=1760378523\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring me Home is a short game about helping a dog return to the city after the events of a very unfortunate night. Join Puffy and help him get back home by getting the necessary resources and helping others along the way. And who knows? maybe you will find a new friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929530/extras/9ee0fc8fa9fa34aef1317a7f43c9991c.avif?t=1760378523\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Simple gameplay with colorful and completely handmade backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-An adventure with very little text, mostly just to indicate basic settings and controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Suitable for everyone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929530/extras/3246d2896749fb5e5058bdbabf1fd00a.avif?t=1760378523\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a passionate, small team of 4 people that finally decided to make their first official videogame.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losu is the one that mostly posts about game updates in his social media, so if you're interested follow him there :)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929530?t=1760378523","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929530?t=1760378523",